# Hurkyl's Final Meditation on Bot1's own turn costs its mana cost, {4}{U}{U}{U}: Bot1 floats exactly seven mana and casts
# it with nothing left over. It returns every nonland permanent to its owner's hand at once - Bot1's Moxen and Sol Ring,
# Bot2's Orcish Bowmasters - and the Orc Army token, in a hand, ceases to exist (CR 704.5d). Then the turn ends (CR
# 724.1): the spell is exiled, the lands stay, and turn 4 is Bot2's.

