Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Hurkyl's Final Meditation
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Emerald
Orcish Bowmasters
Swamp x20

